<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - RADIO NOON HEADLINES - MAY 5.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - RADIO NOON HEADLINES - MAY 5.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines reported by Kuku Radio on Monday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Prime Minister Mart Siimann will visit Finland on Wednesday.</p>
<p>- The Russian Party wishes to continue cooperation with the Coalition Party.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
